AUDIO: '&gt;&gt; Okay. And the thing about these avatars is that you can interrupt them while they\'re talking. You don\'t have to let them finish. So, at that point, I realized how easy it was for me to build this thing into anything I wanted. So, I decided to start building my dream app, which meant adding a ton of features and'

[04:46] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'getting rid of a lot of bugs along the way. But what you see here as this final app began as just a series of iterative conversations with Claude. I didn\'t know exactly where I was going. It was more of a discovery process and a hey, I'

